crewii fetches personas from agency-agents when a crew is opened and embeds
them in generated agent files in the user's project, excluded from Git. The
personas are not redistributed in this repository or its releases.
Generated agent files include attribution; a copy of the upstream license is
included in their agent directory as LICENSE.agency-agents.

